<title>JAPAN: Giken Seisakusho - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Giken Seisakusho - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.77		vs	    4.29</p>
<p> Operating	  916    million    vs	  885    million</p>
<p> Current		1.02		vs	  880    million</p>
<p> Net		  596    million    vs	  420    million</p>
<p> EPS		   27.62 yen	  vs	   21.73 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Giken Seisakusho Co Ltd boasts an overwhelming market share in hydraulic pile pressing and extracting machines.</p>
</text>
